/P 73 0 R
/E (The reporting requirements of the Fair Campaign Practices Act \(FCPA\) apply to all candidates. Candidates should determine as early as possible whether they will remain a standalone candidate or form a candidate committee, because that decision affects registration and reporting obligations. All required campaign finance forms and reports must be filed with the town clerk, and candidates are responsible for understanding the rules that apply once they become a candidate under Colorado law.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
